---
import { discordUrl } from '~/data/content';
---

<section class="py-24 md:py-32">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="grid gap-x-12 gap-y-10 md:grid-cols-12" data-reveal>
      <blockquote class="md:col-span-9">
        <span class="sigil" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <p
          class="serif mt-7 text-[1.875rem] font-medium leading-[1.45] text-ink md:text-[2.5rem]"
        >
          「只要你创作，<br class="hidden sm:block" />你就是其中一员。」
        </p>
        <footer class="mt-8 flex items-center gap-3 border-t border-line pt-4">
          <span class="folio">出处</span>
          <span class="text-[14px] text-ink-soft">
            ArtCraft 社区召集令，收录于 WordCraft 项目说明
          </span>
        </footer>
      </blockquote>

      <div class="md:col-span-3">
        <div class="border-l border-line pl-6 md:border-l-0 md:pl-0 md:pt-1">
          <p class="folio">含义</p>
          <p class="mt-3 text-[15px] leading-[1.8] text-ink-soft">
            这句话出自 ArtCraft 社区。WordCraft 就是给这个社区的：无论你用什么媒介、入行多久，工具都应该跟得上。
          </p>
          <a
            href={discordUrl}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noreferrer noopener"
            class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[14px] text-ink-soft underline underline-offset-4 transition-colors duration-200 hover:text-accent"
          >
            来 Discord 打个招呼
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>